{# The line and the two arrows under a slider that has no strip of colour dots
   (the pieces and "Other glazes" on a glaze page; the glaze slider on the home
   page keeps its dots). The line shows how far along the row one is and how
   much is left -- on a phone too, where nothing else says that the row goes
   on. The arrows are for a mouse: without them the cards past the first view
   could only be reached with the Tab key or Shift and the wheel. They stand
   from lg up; on a phone one swipes.

   Set sliderZiel to the id of the slider before including this file.
   home-slider.js finds the bar by that id, moves the thumb, switches an arrow
   off at either end and hides the whole bar when nothing can be scrolled. The
   thumb's width here is only what shows before the script has run. #}
<div data-slider-nav="{{ sliderZiel }}" class="mt-5 flex items-center gap-5">
    <div class="relative h-0.5 flex-1 bg-hairline" aria-hidden="true">
        <span data-slider-thumb class="absolute -top-px left-0 h-1 w-1/4 rounded-full bg-blue"></span>
    </div>
    <div class="hidden gap-2 lg:flex">
        <button type="button" data-slider-prev disabled aria-label="{{ global.labels.slider_prev | default('Previous', true) }}" class="flex h-10 w-10 cursor-pointer items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-hairline bg-white text-blue transition-colors hover:border-blue disabled:cursor-default disabled:opacity-35 disabled:hover:border-hairline">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" width="16" height="16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 4l-6 6 6 6"/></svg>
        </button>
        <button type="button" data-slider-next aria-label="{{ global.labels.slider_next | default('Next', true) }}" class="flex h-10 w-10 cursor-pointer items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-hairline bg-white text-blue transition-colors hover:border-blue disabled:cursor-default disabled:opacity-35 disabled:hover:border-hairline">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" width="16" height="16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M8 4l6 6-6 6"/></svg>
        </button>
    </div>
</div>
